# English for a Turkish speaker, A1 -> A2, goal: everyday speaking.
# Every unit: words and short sentences (en, tr, emoji) + one teach-first pattern that maps the Turkish
# suffix / word order onto the English pieces (same compact form as the Albanian app's patterns2.py).

def P(id, unit, t, rule, ex, drills):
    return {"id": id, "unit": unit, "t": t, "rule": rule, "ex": ex, "drills": drills}

